The prebuilt binaries shipped with this package are compiled from the QuickJS-ng
sources plus this project's own C++ layer, so they contain QuickJS-ng code under
the license above:

  android/src/main/jniLibs/<abi>/libfjs.so
  ios/fjs.xcframework
  macos/fjs.xcframework

The corresponding sources live in native/ in the project repository
(https://github.com/snice/flutter-js); they are not shipped in the published
package because nothing in a consumer build compiles them.
